<h1>What We Do</h1>
<p>R&amp;D Tax Solutions specializes in R&amp;D tax credit claims. We are Professionals, experienced at guiding companies through the R&amp;D claims process to maximize the levels of tax relief available.</p>
<p>Using our industry knowledge we can help businesses reduce their overall corporation tax burden through the use of R&amp;D tax credits.</p>
<h2>Our Approach</h2>
<ol class="process-list">
<li><h3>Initial Meeting</h3><p>We will schedule an Initial meeting to understand your business and to discuss potential for an R&amp;D claim. Explanation of our process, what’s involved and how we work. We also take this opportunity to identify eligible SR&amp;ED projects.</p></li>
<li><h3>Review Projects with Technical Staff</h3><p>Meeting with project leaders to gather additional information required for the technical report. Eligible expenditures are identified and requested at this time.</p></li>
<li><h3>Prepare Technical Report and Validate All Eligible Costs</h3><p>Based on the technical information gathered during Step 2, we prepare a technical report that meets the requirements of the SR&amp;ED program. During this period, we also summarize all eligible expenditures.</p></li>
<li><h3>Submission of SR&amp;ED Claim</h3><p>Finalization and submission of the R&amp;D claim to CRA for review and approval. It usually takes 3-6 months to receive notification of approval from CRA.</p></li>
</ol>
